## Octopus Integrations Security (v16.1+)
The integration of Octopus MCP plugins (`browser_vision_mcp.json`, `telegram_control_mcp.json`) strictly adheres to the 7-phase constitutional evaluation. External browser and Telegram controls are sandboxed via the RuntimePolicy engine, and all actions must pass through `aios_mcp/gateway.py` with valid `goal`, `scope`, and `risk` parameters.
